# The Rootcore (CIPlay the_rootcore): the core valves refused before the Blightmother falls; then BURN (alone, with
# no Heart choice held, either valve works); the second valve refused after.
island The Rootcore
# RESIZE 10-24: the recipe moved this island's old content by 0 22; the points below are in the old frame
offset 0 -22
expect step 0
expect title The Core
zone mouth
expect step 1
read Expedition sign
expect step 2
# STORY 10-24: Expedition 3's account first - the dive and Oda's log, then the dome
open Skipper's drawer
wait 3
expect story expkey 1
expect step 3
use expbox
expect shown expchest
read Expedition 3 log
expect step 4
zone dome
expect step 5
use coreburn
expect story core 0
kill Warthog
expect step 6
use firebasket1
use firebasket2
kill Mama bear
zone old_root
expect step 8
read The Ringwave root
expect step 9
# REDO 10-24: the valves wait for the three heart shards set into the oldest root
use coreburn
expect story core 0
expect hidden teodortape
use oldroot
expect story rootlit 0
open Mushroom ring
wait 3
open Overgrown chest
wait 3
use dvines
expect shown dvinechest
open Behind the vines
wait 3
expect story shard 3
expect step 10
use oldroot
expect story shard 0
expect story rootlit 1
expect shown teodortape
expect step 11
read Teodor's last tape
expect step 12
use coreburn
expect story core 1
expect shown embers
expect shown heartseed
use coreopen
expect hidden glowgrowth
expect step 13
read The core
expect step 14
use heartseed
expect story heartseed 1
use rangerlock
expect hidden rangercache
expect step 15
zone oda_camp
expect step 16
read Oda Fenn's farewell
expect done
